->@DESCRIPTION  : 3-D diffusion or SPN finite element tracking                            
->@CREDITS      : A. Hebert                                                               
->@COPYRIGHTS   : ECOLE POLYTECHNIQUE DE MONTREAL  
                  GNU LESSER GENERAL PUBLIC LICENSE


 EXEC: TRIVAT:      BY A. HEBERT

 TRITRK: DEGREE OF FINITE ELEMENT IELEM =  1
         TYPE OF QUADRATURE ICOL =  2
         TYPE OF DISCRETIZATION ICHX =  3


 3-D CARTESIAN GEOMETRY.
+                          BASED ON GEOMETRY GEOM        .


 NUMBER OF MESH INTERVALS ALONG THE X AXIS =   44     AVAILABLE STORAGE MAXX =  30000
                          ALONG THE Y AXIS =   30     AVAILABLE STORAGE MAXY =  30000
                          ALONG THE Z AXIS =   22     AVAILABLE STORAGE MAXZ =  30000
 NUMBER OF DISTINCT MIXTURES =  21120


 TRITRK: PERFORM A CYLINDRICAL CORRECTION ON THE CARTESIAN BOUNDARY.

 TRIDFC: MESH CENTERED FINITE DIFFERENCE OR NODAL COLLOCATION METHOD.

 NUMBER OF ELEMENTS ALONG X AXIS = 44
                    ALONG Y AXIS = 30
                    ALONG Z AXIS = 22

 TRITRK: MESH CENTERED FINITE DIFFERENCES.

 TRITRK: ORDER OF LINEAR SYSTEMS =   21120
         NUMBER OF UNKNOWNS PER ENERGY GROUP =   21120

 TRICH1: MAXIMUM BANDWIDTH ALONG X AXIS =    2
                           ALONG Y AXIS =    2
                           ALONG Z AXIS =    2
